WEBVTT

00:08.967 --> 00:09.843
[tense music playing]

00:09.926 --> 00:11.928
You're a part of the Union now!

00:12.012 --> 00:15.348
- So do what I fucking tell you, okay?
- [boy 1] You better fucking answer him!

00:15.432 --> 00:17.642
- Got it?
- Good to see you, hyeong-nim!

00:18.226 --> 00:19.728
[all] Good evening!

00:20.562 --> 00:22.689
What the fuck is this, an organized gang?

00:23.773 --> 00:25.567
Don't speak to me, or get your ass kicked.

00:26.151 --> 00:28.737
The neighbors will file noise complaints,
you fucking idiots.

00:28.820 --> 00:29.988
[all] Sorry, sir.

00:34.451 --> 00:36.369
[boy 2] Drop your head,
you fucking asshole.

00:39.706 --> 00:40.749
[boy 3] Stand up straight!

00:41.249 --> 00:42.208
[excited shouting]

00:42.959 --> 00:44.419
[cheering]

00:47.297 --> 00:48.339
[boy 4] Hello.

00:48.423 --> 00:50.175
- [boy 5] Hello.
- [boy 4] You're here.

00:51.176 --> 00:53.011
[laughter and clapping]

01:06.107 --> 01:07.776
What the hell are you glaring at?

01:09.027 --> 01:10.028
Go inside.

01:27.003 --> 01:29.005
[writing]

01:35.136 --> 01:36.179
Just a minute.

01:41.392 --> 01:42.811
I'm saying this once.

01:44.938 --> 01:46.022
Listen up.

01:48.399 --> 01:52.529
I don't care what Park Hu-min
and all the rest of you are up to.

01:54.322 --> 01:56.241
And I didn't need to be brought here.

01:59.869 --> 02:03.498
But… I'm here
to make this clear to you all.

02:08.920 --> 02:11.589
If you step foot
near Su-ho's hospital again…

02:15.635 --> 02:16.845
you are all dead.

02:18.805 --> 02:20.765
I will certainly kill all of you.

02:23.434 --> 02:24.435
[scoffs]

02:27.689 --> 02:29.399
[sighs]

02:40.493 --> 02:43.163
Separate the variable first
to solve it quickly.

02:45.206 --> 02:48.418
A variable with a fixed range is
no different from a constant.

02:48.501 --> 02:50.587
MATHEMATICS

02:55.967 --> 02:57.218
[Baek-jin] Keep your word.

02:59.012 --> 03:00.847
If you do, no one will get hurt.

03:05.059 --> 03:07.187
I want you to stop hanging around Hu-min.

03:10.440 --> 03:11.441
Sure.

03:13.151 --> 03:14.319
Understood.

03:16.362 --> 03:17.780
And you keep your word.

03:23.036 --> 03:25.038
["Hero" by Meego playing]

03:40.178 --> 03:45.350
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

04:40.321 --> 04:41.823
[bowling pins fall]

04:41.906 --> 04:43.950
[cheering and clapping]

04:44.450 --> 04:45.368
Hey.

04:53.001 --> 04:54.585
Don't look at me like that,

04:55.503 --> 04:57.213
or I'll gouge out both your eyes.

04:58.589 --> 04:59.799
[chuckles]

05:01.301 --> 05:02.844
[players clamoring]

05:10.852 --> 05:12.020
[door opens]

05:14.188 --> 05:16.149
[Seong-je] Do you enjoy looking at that?

05:17.317 --> 05:18.651
[sighs]

05:25.658 --> 05:27.160
We're just letting him go?

05:32.081 --> 05:33.833
Then why did you ask me to bring him?

05:41.591 --> 05:42.967
Do I have to explain it?

05:43.468 --> 05:44.594
[laughs]

05:50.850 --> 05:53.644
I mean, why are you
so fucking obsessed with Eunjang?

05:56.189 --> 05:58.566
It's not like they'll bring us big money.

05:59.817 --> 06:03.905
And you already know you can't own him,
not with power. Right?

06:06.824 --> 06:09.369
[Baek-jin] That's why I need to make him
come here on his own.

06:13.873 --> 06:16.084
Did you send the boys
to Hu-min's restaurant?

06:17.085 --> 06:19.629
[Baku] 44, 45, 46, 47…

06:19.712 --> 06:21.839
LIFE'S TOUGH
BUT IT'S OKAY. I'M TOUGH TOO

06:21.923 --> 06:24.467
…48, 49, 50, 51,

06:24.550 --> 06:27.261
- 52, 53, 54…
- [phone buzzing]

06:27.345 --> 06:30.014
DAD

06:30.723 --> 06:31.766
Five more!

06:32.266 --> 06:34.727
50, 60, 70,

06:34.811 --> 06:37.146
80, 90, 100.

06:37.230 --> 06:38.648
- [buzzing continues]
- Ah!

06:42.568 --> 06:43.653
Yes, abeoji?

06:43.736 --> 06:45.613
- [dad] Are you kidding?
- [man] It's Officer Han.

06:45.696 --> 06:47.698
- [dad] Liars!
- [Han] Your dad got into trouble again.

06:47.782 --> 06:49.826
Come and calm him down, okay?

06:49.909 --> 06:53.830
[dad] How the fuck was I supposed to know
if it was real or fake? Tell the truth!

06:53.913 --> 06:55.832
- [Han] Calm down.
- [officer] We can talk about it.

06:55.915 --> 06:58.793
- [dad] Douchebags! Tell them the truth!
- [Han] Hey. Please calm down.

06:58.876 --> 06:59.919
- Stop!
- I will kill you!

07:00.002 --> 07:01.087
- Keep the kids quiet.
- Sorry.

07:01.170 --> 07:03.297
- [officer] Sir, calm down.
- Abeoji, you need to stop.

07:03.381 --> 07:05.007
Come on. Please stop!

07:06.342 --> 07:07.468
[dad] You little brat.

07:08.010 --> 07:09.595
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- It's okay.

07:09.679 --> 07:11.389
What are you sorry for, you punk?

07:11.472 --> 07:13.224
You didn't do anything wrong!
Why apologize?

07:13.307 --> 07:15.059
Abeoji, please!

07:15.143 --> 07:19.439
Sir, I understand,
but we still need to fill out a report.

07:20.022 --> 07:21.732
There are protocols
for situations like this.

07:21.816 --> 07:24.694
I even checked their IDs!
They weren't fucking minors!

07:24.777 --> 07:27.655
- I checked their goddamn photos!
- [officer] We can talk at the station.

07:27.738 --> 07:30.158
[Han] You did sell alcohol
to underage students though, right?

07:30.241 --> 07:31.409
[dad] Fucking seriously…

07:31.492 --> 07:33.536
- [boy 1] Man!
- Let's go. All right?

07:34.245 --> 07:35.288
Uh-huh.

07:35.371 --> 07:37.415
[officer] Officer Kim,
get them in the car too.

07:37.498 --> 07:38.666
[Kim] Hey! Get in the car!

07:39.584 --> 07:43.045
- Come on, let's go. Hurry up.
- [boy 1] I'm walking. Jeez, man.

07:43.129 --> 07:44.422
[boy 2] Stop pushing me.

07:44.505 --> 07:47.633
Hey. Baek-jin hyeong
asked me to tell you this.

07:47.717 --> 07:48.759
"I miss you."

07:48.843 --> 07:50.845
[tense music playing]

07:54.724 --> 07:56.601
[breathing shakily]

07:56.684 --> 07:57.810
[phone buzzing]

07:59.812 --> 08:03.649
NA BAEK-JIN

08:14.952 --> 08:16.037
Where are you?

08:16.954 --> 08:17.955
[Baek-jin] Tomorrow.

08:19.290 --> 08:20.541
I'll send the address.

08:24.921 --> 08:27.006
[boys chatting and yelling]

08:27.089 --> 08:29.175
- [boy 1] Stop running!
- [horn honks]

08:35.848 --> 08:37.099
[Baek-jin] Keep your word.

08:41.354 --> 08:43.105
If you do, no one will get hurt.

08:51.906 --> 08:54.283
- [ball bouncing]
- [Gotak] Lower your stance a little more.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.994
Keep looking straight ahead.
Yeah, that's it.

08:57.078 --> 09:00.540
That's right. It'll feel more natural
after about a hundred times.

09:00.623 --> 09:02.458
Good. Nice.

09:04.669 --> 09:07.630
- Oh… Yeon Si-eun.
- [Jun-tae] Si-eun.

09:08.506 --> 09:11.300
[Gotak] What brings you here?
Are you joining our club?

09:11.384 --> 09:12.426
[Baku sighs]

09:12.510 --> 09:15.846
Well, if you want to join, you'll have
to go through a vigorous tryout process.

09:15.930 --> 09:17.223
I met Na Baek-jin.

09:18.891 --> 09:20.101
The kid in the Union.

09:21.561 --> 09:22.603
You what?

09:26.941 --> 09:29.193
Na Baek-jin, that crazy asshole.

09:29.277 --> 09:30.319
Hey, did…

09:31.404 --> 09:32.613
did anything happen?

09:33.531 --> 09:34.615
Nothing happened.

09:36.701 --> 09:40.288
I don't care what you guys do or who with.
Leave me out of it.

09:42.290 --> 09:43.332
Si-eun-a,

09:44.041 --> 09:45.960
wh… what's with you all of a sudden?

09:46.043 --> 09:48.212
I don't have the free time
like you guys do.

09:48.296 --> 09:51.507
I've got a lot of things to do.
You can have fun without me.

09:52.341 --> 09:54.552
[Gotak] What the hell
are you talking about?

09:55.052 --> 09:57.430
Did we ever ask you to hang out with us?

09:57.513 --> 09:58.514
Exactly.

09:59.599 --> 10:01.267
So let's just ignore each other.

10:05.187 --> 10:06.897
- [Baku] Okay.
- [Gotak sighs]

10:06.981 --> 10:08.441
[Baku] I get what you're saying.

10:12.903 --> 10:13.904
Let's do that.

10:15.906 --> 10:17.825
Let's ignore each other from now on.

10:19.535 --> 10:20.578
We good?

10:21.996 --> 10:22.997
Yes.

10:29.378 --> 10:30.630
[door slams]

10:38.971 --> 10:40.014
Si-eun-a.

10:48.189 --> 10:51.567
Something's making Baku act
like this on purpose, right?

10:51.651 --> 10:52.735
And you too?

10:56.572 --> 10:59.408
I have, um, no idea what happened to you,

11:00.868 --> 11:02.995
but I know Baku didn't mean what he said.

11:03.788 --> 11:05.498
You don't need to worry about it.

11:08.167 --> 11:09.752
- Jun-tae-ya.
- Yes?

11:15.800 --> 11:16.801
I just…

11:20.763 --> 11:22.431
I'm more comfortable alone.

11:23.516 --> 11:25.309
[poignant music playing]

11:37.655 --> 11:38.656
[teacher] …is so.

11:38.739 --> 11:42.451
Now, that's for transformers,
which is a typical example

11:42.535 --> 11:43.869
of mutual induction.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.830
Let's take a look at another example.

11:45.913 --> 11:47.331
[chalk tapping chalkboard]

11:48.457 --> 11:50.668
[train horn blares]

12:04.682 --> 12:06.267
[boy 1] Huh? One second.

12:08.018 --> 12:09.061
Hey, Eunjang.

12:14.400 --> 12:15.568
Where are your friends?

12:23.826 --> 12:26.954
[boy 2] Wait, didn't Baek-jin tell us
to leave this kid alone?

12:27.538 --> 12:28.789
[boy 1] He did?

12:29.999 --> 12:31.041
Let's just go.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.297
[sighs] Shit.

12:36.964 --> 12:38.215
[boy 2] Where's Seong-je?

12:39.091 --> 12:40.885
[boy 1] Don't know.
He said he'd come by later.

12:43.471 --> 12:44.930
[train passing]

12:45.014 --> 12:46.348
[sighs]

12:52.772 --> 12:54.857
[Gotak] Jun-tae, where's Si-eun?

12:54.940 --> 12:57.318
[Jun-tae] He left right after
the end-of-day announcements.

12:57.401 --> 12:58.402
[Gotak] He left?

13:00.780 --> 13:02.823
Man, what is wrong with him?

13:04.575 --> 13:05.951
Have you talked to him at all?

13:07.077 --> 13:07.953
[Jun-tae] No.

13:09.079 --> 13:10.080
But, I mean,

13:11.457 --> 13:13.709
I'm not sure, but I think I have an idea.

13:15.419 --> 13:18.130
I don't think Si-eun meant
what he said either.

13:24.428 --> 13:26.388
I'll take off first. See you tomorrow.

13:26.889 --> 13:27.932
[Gotak] Hey, man.

13:28.432 --> 13:30.601
You aren't gonna meet up
with Na Baek-jin, are you?

13:31.560 --> 13:32.937
It's nothing like that.

13:33.437 --> 13:35.064
Get home safe. See ya later.

13:37.358 --> 13:38.776
[Gotak] Then where are you going?

13:38.859 --> 13:40.861
To Buil Girls' High. Hot date.

13:44.031 --> 13:45.115
[sighs]

13:57.461 --> 13:58.462
Let's go.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.551
Call Seong-je.

14:04.969 --> 14:06.971
[tense music playing]

14:07.513 --> 14:08.681
[Gotak sighs]

14:11.100 --> 14:12.977
Where could it be?

14:13.060 --> 14:15.813
I dropped my toy here, somewhere.

14:17.356 --> 14:18.315
[grunts]

14:23.779 --> 14:25.281
[Seong-je] It's been a while.

14:28.826 --> 14:30.035
[inaudible]

14:30.119 --> 14:31.245
[Seong-je] How's your knee?

14:36.417 --> 14:38.878
[sighs] What brings you
to this neighborhood?

14:39.378 --> 14:42.089
Wait, where's the newbie guy?
Yeon Si-eun, right?

14:42.756 --> 14:44.425
I thought it'd be fun to play with him.

14:44.508 --> 14:45.509
Is it fun

14:47.094 --> 14:48.762
to play Na Baek-jin's minion?

14:51.015 --> 14:52.057
It is.

14:53.142 --> 14:55.185
I get to beat the hell out of you shits.

15:00.357 --> 15:02.818
You fucking counting?
There's obviously four.

15:05.154 --> 15:06.447
You're my playmate.

15:08.198 --> 15:10.951
What? You scared? [laughs]

15:11.035 --> 15:12.119
Go, Jun-tae.

15:13.913 --> 15:14.914
Huh?

15:15.456 --> 15:17.458
Hurry up and get out of here, you idiot!

15:17.541 --> 15:19.084
[laughing]

15:21.795 --> 15:23.339
You're so freaking cool.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.674
[boy 1] You son of a bitch. Hey!

15:27.426 --> 15:29.929
- [boy 2] Hey, fuck you.
- [boy 1] Get back here, you little bitch!

15:30.930 --> 15:32.681
What a load of bullshit.

15:33.849 --> 15:36.185
[lighter clicking]

15:40.314 --> 15:41.774
Instead of this place,

15:42.483 --> 15:44.276
let's go somewhere quiet.

15:48.405 --> 15:49.865
Lose that glare,

15:50.824 --> 15:52.201
you fucking loser.

15:52.785 --> 15:54.787
[laughing]

15:55.287 --> 15:56.705
[boy 2] Tiny little shit!

15:58.082 --> 15:59.375
[panting]

15:59.458 --> 16:01.460
[boy 1] Where you running to, asshole?

16:01.543 --> 16:03.128
- [boy 1] Hey!
- [boy 2] You!

16:06.006 --> 16:07.341
Hey, you fucking idiot!

16:08.884 --> 16:10.010
Hey, asshole!

16:11.136 --> 16:12.262
Little piece of shit!

16:14.348 --> 16:15.516
[boy 2] Stop running!

16:21.188 --> 16:22.564
- Go that way.
- Okay.

16:27.486 --> 16:29.446
- [phone ringing]
- Fuck.

16:30.864 --> 16:31.907
Hey, Seong-je.

16:32.866 --> 16:34.326
I have to find one more kid?

16:35.494 --> 16:36.578
Yeon Si-eun?

16:37.204 --> 16:39.790
[panting] Damn, I let him go earlier.

16:40.666 --> 16:41.667
On it.

16:47.381 --> 16:48.882
[panting]

16:52.052 --> 16:53.220
PARK HU-MIN

16:54.430 --> 16:57.099
The number you have dialed
is not available. Pl--

16:57.182 --> 16:58.392
[whimpers]

17:01.311 --> 17:03.313
[phone buzzing]

17:13.574 --> 17:16.076
SEO JUN-TAE
MISSED CALL

17:16.160 --> 17:20.456
SEO JUN-TAE:
ARE YOU ON YOUR WAY TO HAGWON?

17:37.639 --> 17:39.641
[phone buzzing]

17:40.309 --> 17:42.311
[panting]

17:46.732 --> 17:47.816
Oh, hello?

17:48.984 --> 17:51.195
- Hey, Si-eun-a.
- [Si-eun] What is it? This is random.

17:53.197 --> 17:56.408
Oh, I was wondering if you
made it okay to your cram school.

17:59.161 --> 18:00.954
Why did you suddenly want to know that?

18:02.372 --> 18:03.373
Uh…

18:05.000 --> 18:09.630
I was honestly just wondering
if you made it to the cram school.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.049
That's why I called.

18:13.592 --> 18:14.718
Mm-hmm.

18:14.802 --> 18:15.886
- [gasps] Oh no.
- [boy 2] Hey!

18:16.887 --> 18:18.555
[Jun-tae] Si-eun-a, don't worry, I'm fine.

18:18.639 --> 18:20.224
- Go straight home after.
- [boy 2] Finally.

18:20.307 --> 18:21.558
- [crashing]
- Hello? Seo Jun-tae?

18:21.642 --> 18:23.852
- [boy 2] Why'd you keep running?
- [Jun-tae gasping]

18:23.936 --> 18:25.646
- [boy 2] Bro, fuck you!
- [blow lands]

18:25.729 --> 18:27.773
- [boy 1] Lift up your head.
- [boy 2] Lift it, bitch.

18:27.856 --> 18:29.858
[dramatic music playing]

18:34.571 --> 18:36.657
- Damn, I thought I'd win.
- It's the best outfit I have.

18:36.740 --> 18:39.201
So close, man. All right,
this time I'm gonna win all the money.

18:39.284 --> 18:41.495
- All right, one more. One more.
- Give me a smoke.

18:41.578 --> 18:43.122
- I just quit.
- Okay, just one more.

18:43.205 --> 18:44.456
We aren't open yet.

18:48.210 --> 18:49.795
Where's Baek-jin?

18:50.462 --> 18:52.798
- [laughs] "Baek-jin"?
- "Baek-jin"?

18:54.007 --> 18:56.051
- He called him Baek-jin.
- [laughs]

18:56.135 --> 18:58.095
Oh, wow, this guy's freakin' nuts.

18:58.178 --> 18:59.346
[boy 1] Legit. Whatever, man.

18:59.429 --> 19:01.598
Hey, isn't he Park Hu-min?

19:02.558 --> 19:04.143
- [boy 1] Park Hu-min?
- [boy 2] Who's that?

19:04.226 --> 19:07.187
- [boy 3] Sounds familiar.
- [boy 4] He runs the show at Eunjang High.

19:07.271 --> 19:09.356
- [boy 5] He's Park Hu-min?
- [boy 2] Keep playing cards.

19:09.439 --> 19:11.859
- [boy 6] Wow, he's really something.
- [boy 5] I mean, it's…

19:12.734 --> 19:13.777
[boy 2] Fuck.

19:17.197 --> 19:18.198
[sighs]

19:19.950 --> 19:21.118
Na Baek-jin.

19:22.452 --> 19:23.662
Where is he?

19:31.628 --> 19:32.838
[Baek-jin] It's been a while.

19:33.463 --> 19:34.464
[scoffs]

19:47.352 --> 19:48.687
[tense music playing]

19:48.770 --> 19:49.855
[Baku sighs]

19:56.570 --> 19:58.030
[Baek-jin] Park Hu-min.

19:59.448 --> 20:01.408
I still think of you as a good friend.

20:04.203 --> 20:05.329
[scoffs]

20:07.456 --> 20:10.083
Joining the Union isn't
a bad offer for you to take.

20:11.543 --> 20:12.711
It'll be worth it.

20:13.837 --> 20:16.256
Turning into a sound business
once we graduate.

20:17.424 --> 20:19.176
Everything is planned out.

20:19.927 --> 20:20.928
[scoffs]

20:24.806 --> 20:25.807
[sighs]

20:27.726 --> 20:30.395
I've come to realize that
you're a freaking dumbass.

20:37.486 --> 20:38.487
Hey.

20:39.780 --> 20:41.073
Stupid dickhead.

20:44.743 --> 20:47.996
Do you really not know
why I want no part in all this bullying?

20:50.582 --> 20:52.584
Or are you just pretending not to know?

20:57.256 --> 20:58.465
I just…

21:01.760 --> 21:03.595
hate your fucking guts.

21:07.015 --> 21:08.141
[chuckles]

21:08.642 --> 21:09.685
[scoffs]

21:15.565 --> 21:18.110
You're the dumbass here,
not me, you got that?

21:22.531 --> 21:24.366
What the fuck did you do this time?

21:27.327 --> 21:28.954
Is Go Hyun-tak doing well?

21:29.705 --> 21:30.831
[suspenseful music playing]

21:39.673 --> 21:41.425
[Baku scoffs]

21:49.891 --> 21:50.726
Hey. Hey.

21:51.476 --> 21:52.602
[boy 1 chuckles]

21:54.896 --> 21:56.481
Baek-jin said you can leave?

21:57.441 --> 21:58.483
I highly doubt that.

21:59.609 --> 22:01.236
I don't have time to waste.

22:02.654 --> 22:03.947
Let's get this over with.

22:05.073 --> 22:06.825
[dramatic music playing]

22:06.908 --> 22:08.785
[both grunting]

22:32.100 --> 22:33.060
[gasps]

22:33.143 --> 22:36.104
[Seong-je] Your punches are
still so weak. Huh?

22:37.439 --> 22:38.357
[scoffs]

22:39.775 --> 22:40.776
[Gotak] You asshole.

22:43.570 --> 22:44.821
[laughs]

22:44.905 --> 22:46.073
[Gotak grunts]

22:48.367 --> 22:49.993
[yelps] Damn!

22:50.577 --> 22:51.578
[groans]

22:52.579 --> 22:54.373
[wheezing]

22:56.875 --> 22:59.127
- [Seong-je] Hey, we're not done yet.
- [groaning]

22:59.211 --> 23:00.921
[Seong-je] Get up, you fucking moron.

23:03.965 --> 23:05.550
Fucking shit.

23:07.594 --> 23:09.471
- [boy 2] Fuck you.
- Come on.

23:11.765 --> 23:12.766
[boy 3] Fuck you.

23:12.849 --> 23:14.684
[spluttering]

23:15.685 --> 23:16.978
[yelping]

23:17.062 --> 23:18.397
[moaning]

23:18.980 --> 23:19.981
Keep going?

23:20.065 --> 23:22.401
- [boy 4] Fuck you. Hey, hey, hey!
- [boy 2] Shit.

23:22.484 --> 23:24.569
[groaning] Oh God.

23:24.653 --> 23:26.196
[boy 5] Hey! Fuck you!

23:26.279 --> 23:27.489
[boy 6] Shit!

23:27.989 --> 23:29.366
[boy 4] Fuck you!

23:30.534 --> 23:32.160
You goddamn fuck!

23:37.249 --> 23:38.500
[boy 7] Fuck you!

23:38.583 --> 23:40.585
[screams]

23:42.504 --> 23:43.880
[yelling]

23:46.466 --> 23:47.801
Can I go yet?

23:51.513 --> 23:52.472
[thud]

23:53.515 --> 23:55.308
- [Baek-jin] That's enough.
- [sighs]

23:55.392 --> 23:56.685
[music stops]

23:57.269 --> 23:58.437
[sighs]

24:02.524 --> 24:04.067
That's enough. Let him go.

24:06.611 --> 24:09.156
Take a good look
and get a grasp on the situation.

24:10.157 --> 24:12.159
See how long you'll be able to hold out.

24:14.744 --> 24:15.787
[scoffs]

24:17.080 --> 24:18.081
Hey.

24:20.417 --> 24:22.961
You're not doing me a favor
by letting me leave.

24:24.838 --> 24:26.506
It's quite the opposite.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.594
I just about killed everyone here.

24:34.222 --> 24:36.224
[tense music playing]

24:42.772 --> 24:43.773
[scoffs]

24:44.274 --> 24:45.734
[panting]

24:45.817 --> 24:46.902
Damn it!

24:54.659 --> 24:57.537
[boy 1] Hey, I heard Hyun-tak
went to fight Seong-je.

24:57.621 --> 25:00.957
[boy 2] Hyun-tak is fucking screwed.
I heard Seong-je was a total psycho.

25:01.041 --> 25:03.585
- [boy 1] Want to watch? I got the address.
- [boy 2] No, thanks.

25:03.668 --> 25:04.961
- I don't wanna die.
- Hey.

25:07.589 --> 25:08.965
[Gotak groans]

25:11.760 --> 25:12.844
[wheezing]

25:20.018 --> 25:21.353
Stop it!

25:21.436 --> 25:23.104
Get over here. Hey.

25:23.188 --> 25:24.439
This little guy's adorable.

25:25.023 --> 25:27.025
- Look at this little shit.
- [Jun-tae] Stop it!

25:27.108 --> 25:29.110
- [boy 1] Fucking idiot.
- [Jun-tae sobbing] Stop it.

25:29.194 --> 25:31.863
Please stop! [coughs]

25:32.447 --> 25:33.823
[boy 1] Oh, fuck this.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.993
Oh! [whimpers]

25:39.829 --> 25:41.456
[grunts]

25:42.040 --> 25:43.458
Hey, you fucker!

25:43.959 --> 25:45.961
[wheezing noisily]

25:46.461 --> 25:47.754
[Seong-je sighs]

25:54.052 --> 25:56.137
[groaning]

25:57.889 --> 25:58.807
[Seong-je] Glasses.

25:59.474 --> 26:01.977
- [Gotak coughs]
- [Jun-tae] Are you okay, Hyun-tak?

26:06.106 --> 26:08.775
[Seong-je] It's time for a photo.
Look over here.

26:10.318 --> 26:13.947
One, two, three. Hey, dumb fucks.

26:14.614 --> 26:16.616
- [Jun-tae shudders]
- [Seong-je] Look over here.

26:18.702 --> 26:20.287
Are… are you sad?

26:21.705 --> 26:23.290
Should I beat him some more?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.209
Let's wrap this up.

26:27.377 --> 26:31.089
Give me a big smile, all right.
One, two, three. Say "Kimchi!"

26:31.172 --> 26:33.008
- [shutter clicks]
- [banging]

26:33.091 --> 26:34.467
[running footsteps]

26:39.681 --> 26:41.725
[panting]

26:41.808 --> 26:43.810
[tense music playing]

26:48.023 --> 26:49.274
[Seong-je] Newbie!

26:53.486 --> 26:55.530
- [Gotak groans]
- [Seong-je] I missed you.

26:58.908 --> 26:59.909
[sighs]

27:00.910 --> 27:02.537
Today is so fun.

27:03.079 --> 27:06.708
Ooh, is it my birthday?
Maybe I should buy a lottery ticket.

27:06.791 --> 27:08.710
[chuckling]

27:17.761 --> 27:21.097
- [Si-eun gasping]
- You gonna stab me with this? [laughs]

27:22.474 --> 27:24.017
[Si-eun straining]

27:32.901 --> 27:33.943
[Jun-tae whimpers]

27:37.781 --> 27:39.616
You're just a fucking wuss.

27:41.201 --> 27:42.327
I'm getting bored.

27:46.790 --> 27:47.791
Fuck you.

27:52.712 --> 27:53.755
[sighs]

27:55.340 --> 27:57.759
[sounds become muffled and echoing]

28:25.745 --> 28:26.996
[sounds return]

28:27.080 --> 28:28.957
Damn it! [screams]

28:29.749 --> 28:31.543
[dramatic music playing]

28:36.089 --> 28:37.674
- [Seong-je] Fuck you!
- [grunts]

28:38.508 --> 28:40.510
[both grunting]

28:42.053 --> 28:43.930
Release, you stupid…

28:44.514 --> 28:45.765
[Si-eun growling]

28:46.891 --> 28:48.435
[Seong-je wails]

28:50.395 --> 28:52.147
- [screams]
- [Si-eun coughs]

28:52.230 --> 28:53.648
[both grunting]

28:56.860 --> 28:58.194
[Seong-je screams]

29:05.201 --> 29:07.203
[laughing]

29:08.246 --> 29:09.247
Yeah, that's it.

29:13.918 --> 29:15.879
[grunting]

29:17.464 --> 29:18.631
- [crack]
- [yells]

29:28.892 --> 29:30.059
[yells]

29:33.646 --> 29:35.648
- [yells]
- [screams]

29:37.984 --> 29:39.068
Come here!

29:43.698 --> 29:45.366
[breathing unsteadily]

29:54.501 --> 29:55.877
- Hey, hey, hey!
- [grunts]

29:57.504 --> 29:59.506
[grunting]

30:07.180 --> 30:08.640
[Seong-je groans] Fuck you!

30:08.723 --> 30:10.391
[Si-eun yells]

30:10.475 --> 30:12.310
- [groaning]
- [Seong-je] Let go of me, you bitch!

30:12.894 --> 30:14.771
[Si-eun roaring]

30:22.529 --> 30:24.572
- [screaming]
- Fuck you.

30:24.656 --> 30:26.658
[Si-eun screaming]

30:32.580 --> 30:34.249
[both panting]

30:38.878 --> 30:40.630
[wheezing and laughing]

30:46.344 --> 30:47.720
[Si-eun coughs]

30:50.139 --> 30:52.392
- [Seong-je] You fucking moron.
- [groaning]

30:54.102 --> 30:56.062
[Seong-je] Get up, you fucking bastard.

30:56.938 --> 30:57.814
Fuck you, bitch.

30:59.274 --> 31:00.984
[Si-eun wheezing]

31:05.280 --> 31:07.240
[panting]

31:11.452 --> 31:13.246
[Seong-je laughs]

31:13.913 --> 31:15.164
So this will

31:15.999 --> 31:17.917
only end after I kill you, right?

31:18.001 --> 31:19.377
[chuckles]

31:25.049 --> 31:26.301
[screams]

31:27.886 --> 31:29.095
[groans]

31:38.813 --> 31:40.231
[gasping]

31:42.859 --> 31:43.735
[Seong-je sighs]

31:45.528 --> 31:47.530
[wheezing and chuckling]

31:52.368 --> 31:53.328
[groans]

31:53.411 --> 31:55.163
[chuckles and sighs]

31:56.122 --> 31:58.124
[distant siren wailing]

32:10.929 --> 32:13.056
[gasping]

32:18.102 --> 32:20.271
Yeon Si-eun. Yeon Si-eun. You okay?

32:20.355 --> 32:21.356
Yeon Si-eun!

32:28.988 --> 32:30.198
Su-ho-ya.

32:33.409 --> 32:35.119
I got into another fight.

32:40.041 --> 32:41.751
I'm sorry.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.882
["Homesick" by Benzamin playing]

